## Extracted Lemma Shape
  Mixed even-safe components have exact gate words.  A proof may use
  survivor mass only after retaining the local word:
    adjacent bad-core covers + endpoint labels + branch mask + parent E wall.
  Legal exits are now finite: a gate is a direct branch relocation witness,
  a corridor-fence instance, an endpoint-spine/wall certificate, an
  owner-current exception, a two-adic loss/debt case, an overlap-cut bridge,
  or a signed-SPEC route.  The raw scalar survivor count is a negative
  control unless it reconstructs one of those sidecars.
  Canonical rows add a mod-35 endpoint law: outer 13/7 edge gates vanish
  exactly at multiples of 7, inner 11/5 edge gates vanish exactly at
  multiples of 5, and the lcm case survives as clean E_safe.

